<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-PT">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tiago Rocha — Treino Personalizado</title>
<meta name="description" content="Treino individual, adaptado ao seu corpo e à sua rotina. Avaliação inicial gratuita e acompanhamento próximo para você não desistir no meio do caminho.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #0D0D0F;
    --bg-soft: #111113;
    --surface: #17171A;
    --surface-2: #1E1E22;
    --line: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    --line-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    --text: #F4F4F3;
    --muted: #9C9C9F;
    --muted-2: #6D6D70;
    --red: #E63946;
    --red-light: #FF5C67;
    --lime: #C6F135;
    --radius: 16px;
    --display: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Inter', sans-serif;
    --sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:var(--sans);
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;}
  section{position:relative; padding:120px 0;}
  @media (max-width:768px){ section{padding:80px 0;} }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--sans); font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--red-light);
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{ content:''; width:24px; height:2px; background:var(--red-light); }
  h1, h2, h3{ font-family:var(--display); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.01em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  h2{ font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px); line-height:1.1; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .lede{ font-size:17.5px; color:var(--muted); max-width:56ch; font-family:var(--sans); text-transform:none; }

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    padding:16px 32px; border-radius:8px;
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:700; font-size:17px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.02em;
    cursor:pointer; transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
    border:1px solid transparent;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-light), var(--red));
    color:#0D0D0F;
    box-shadow:0 8px 30px -8px rgba(230,57,70,.55);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 14px 36px -10px rgba(230,57,70,.65); }
  .btn-ghost{ background:transparent; border-color:var(--line-strong); color:var(--text); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color:var(--lime); color:var(--lime); }

  .reveal{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); transition:opacity .8s ease, transform .8s ease; }
  .reveal.in{ opacity:1; transform:none; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .reveal{ opacity:1; transform:none; transition:none; }
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
  }

  /* ============ NAV ============ */
  header{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:80;
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    background:rgba(13,13,15,.75);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav.wrap{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; height:76px; }
  .logo{ font-family:var(--display); font-size:22px; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.01em; }
  .logo span{ color:var(--red-light); }
  .nav-links{ display:flex; gap:34px; font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); }
  .nav-links a:hover{ color:var(--text); }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .nav-links{display:none;} }

  /* ============ 01 HERO ============ */
  .hero{
    padding-top:190px; padding-bottom:110px; position:relative;
    background:
      radial-gradient(600px 420px at 85% 4%, rgba(230,57,70,.18), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(480px 360px at 4% 92%, rgba(198,241,53,.07), transparent 70%);
  }
  .hero-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr .85fr; gap:64px; align-items:center; }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .hero h1{ font-size:clamp(42px, 5.6vw, 68px); line-height:1.02; margin-bottom:24px; }
  .hero h1 em{ font-style:normal; color:var(--red-light); }
  .hero .lede{ margin-bottom:36px; }
  .hero-cta-row{ display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; }
  .hero-note{ margin-top:22px; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted-2); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .hero-note .dot{ width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--lime); }

  .hero-visual{
    position:relative; border-radius:20px; border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background:linear-gradient(165deg, var(--surface), var(--surface-2));
    padding:30px; box-shadow:0 40px 80px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
  }
  .stat-row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:22px; }
  .stat-row .label{ font-family:var(--sans); font-size:12px; color:var(--muted-2); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; }
  .progress-track{ height:10px; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg); overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .progress-fill{ height:100%; border-radius:6px; background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red), var(--red-light)); }
  .week-row{ display:flex; gap:8px; margin:22px 0; }
  .week-day{
    flex:1; aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:8px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:14px; font-weight:700;
    background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--muted-2);
  }
  .week-day.done{ background:rgba(230,57,70,.15); border-color:var(--red); color:var(--red-light); }
  .week-day.today{ background:rgba(198,241,53,.15); border-color:var(--lime); color:var(--lime); }
  .hero-stats{ display:flex; gap:28px; margin-top:8px; }
  .hero-stat b{ display:block; font-family:var(--display); font-size:26px; color:var(--red-light); }
  .hero-stat span{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--muted-2); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; }

  /* ============ 02 PROBLEMA ============ */
  .problema{ background:var(--bg-soft); border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .problema-head{ max-width:640px; margin-bottom:56px; }
  .problem-list{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr); gap:18px; }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .problem-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .problem-item{
    display:flex; gap:16px; padding:26px; border-radius:var(--radius);
    background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .problem-item .mark{
    flex-shrink:0; width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid var(--lime); color:var(--lime);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:16px; font-weight:700;
  }
  .problem-item p{ font-size:15.5px; color:var(--muted); }
  .problem-item strong{ color:var(--text); }

  /* ============ 03 SOLUÇÃO ============ */
  .solucao .wrap{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr; gap:70px; align-items:center; }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .solucao .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .solucao-copy p{ color:var(--muted); font-size:16.5px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .solucao-copy p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .solucao-copy strong{ color:var(--red-light); font-weight:700; }
  .solucao-panel{
    border-radius:20px; border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background:linear-gradient(150deg, var(--surface), var(--surface-2));
    padding:38px;
  }
  .solucao-panel .step-mini{ display:flex; gap:14px; padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .solucao-panel .step-mini:last-child{ border-bottom:none; }
  .step-num-mini{ font-family:var(--display); font-size:20px; font-weight:800; color:var(--red-light); width:32px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .step-mini h4{ font-family:var(--sans); font-size:15px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px; text-transform:none; }
  .step-mini p{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--muted-2); }

  /* ============ 04 BENEFÍCIOS ============ */
  .beneficios-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:22px; margin-top:56px; }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .beneficios-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .beneficios-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .beneficio-card{
    padding:30px 26px; border-radius:var(--radius);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.02); border:1px solid var(--line);
    transition:border-color .3s ease, transform .3s ease, background .3s ease;
  }
  .beneficio-card:hover{ border-color:rgba(230,57,70,.45); transform:translateY(-4px); background:rgba(255,255,255,.035); }
  .beneficio-icon{
    width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:12px;
    background:linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(230,57,70,.22), rgba(230,57,70,.05));
    border:1px solid rgba(230,57,70,.4);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-size:18px; margin-bottom:18px; color:var(--red-light);
  }
  .beneficio-card h3{ font-family:var(--sans); font-size:16.5px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px; text-transform:none; }
  .beneficio-card p{ font-size:14.5px; color:var(--muted); }

  /* ============ 05 COMO FUNCIONA ============ */
  .como-funciona{ background:var(--bg-soft); border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .timeline{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:0; margin-top:60px; position:relative; }
  @media (max-width:800px){ .timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:36px;} }
  .timeline::before{
    content:''; position:absolute; top:26px; left:8%; right:8%; height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--line-strong) 15%, var(--line-strong) 85%, transparent);
  }
  @media (max-width:800px){ .timeline::before{ display:none; } }
  .tl-step{ text-align:center; padding:0 20px; position:relative; }
  .tl-num{
    width:54px; height:54px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--red);
    color:var(--red-light);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:22px; font-weight:800;
    margin:0 auto 22px; position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .tl-step h3{ font-family:var(--sans); font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px; text-transform:none; }
  .tl-step p{ font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); max-width:26ch; margin:0 auto; }

  /* ============ 06 DEPOIMENTOS ============ */
  .depoimentos-label{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted-2); text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px; font-family:var(--sans); text-transform:none; }
  .depoimentos-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:22px; margin-top:44px; }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .depoimentos-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .depoimento-card{
    padding:32px 28px; border-radius:var(--radius);
    background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:18px;
  }
  .stars{ color:var(--lime); font-size:15px; letter-spacing:2px; }
  .depoimento-card p{ font-size:15px; color:var(--text); font-style:italic; line-height:1.65; font-family:var(--sans); text-transform:none; }
  .depo-author{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-top:auto; }
  .depo-avatar{
    width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%;
    background:linear-gradient(140deg, var(--red), var(--lime));
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:800; color:#0D0D0F; font-size:15px;
  }
  .depo-author strong{ font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700; display:block; font-family:var(--sans); text-transform:none; }
  .depo-author span{ font-size:12px; color:var(--muted-2); }

  /* ============ 07 OFERTA ============ */
  .oferta-panel{
    max-width:820px; margin:56px auto 0;
    border-radius:22px; border:1px solid rgba(230,57,70,.4);
    background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(230,57,70,.09), rgba(255,255,255,.015));
    padding:50px;
  }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .oferta-panel{ padding:32px 24px; } }
  .oferta-top{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:24px; margin-bottom:30px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .oferta-price{ text-align:right; }
  .oferta-price b{ font-family:var(--display); font-size:26px; color:var(--red-light); display:block; }
  .oferta-price span{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted-2); font-family:var(--sans); }
  .oferta-checklist{ list-style:none; display:grid; gap:14px; margin-bottom:32px; }
  .oferta-checklist li{ display:flex; gap:12px; font-size:15px; color:var(--text); font-family:var(--sans); }
  .oferta-checklist li::before{ content:'✓'; color:var(--lime); font-weight:700; flex-shrink:0; }
  .trust-box{ border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:26px; display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; }
  .trust-box .mark{ color:var(--lime); font-size:18px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .trust-box p{ font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); font-family:var(--sans); }

  /* ============ 08 FAQ ============ */
  .faq-list{ max-width:760px; margin:52px auto 0; display:grid; gap:2px; }
  .faq-item{ border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; background:var(--surface); }
  .faq-q{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:22px 26px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:600; font-size:15.5px; user-select:none; font-family:var(--sans); text-transform:none; }
  .faq-q .plus{ color:var(--red-light); font-size:20px; transition:transform .3s ease; flex-shrink:0; margin-left:16px; }
  .faq-item.open .plus{ transform:rotate(45deg); }
  .faq-a{ max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height .35s ease; padding:0 26px; }
  .faq-a p{ font-size:14.5px; color:var(--muted); padding-bottom:22px; }
  .faq-item.open .faq-a{ max-height:220px; }

  /* ============ 09 CTA FINAL ============ */
  .cta-final{
    text-align:center;
    background: radial-gradient(700px 400px at 50% 0%, rgba(230,57,70,.16), transparent 70%);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .cta-final h2{ max-width:18ch; margin:0 auto 18px; }
  .cta-final .lede{ margin:0 auto 40px; }

  /* ============ FOOTER ============ */
  footer{ border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:56px 0 40px; }
  .footer-grid{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .footer-brand .logo{ margin-bottom:10px; }
  .footer-brand p{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--muted-2); max-width:32ch; font-family:var(--sans); }
  .footer-contact{ text-align:right; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--muted); font-family:var(--sans); }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .footer-contact{ text-align:left; } }
  .footer-contact a{ color:var(--red-light); }
  .footer-bottom{
    margin-top:40px; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:12px; color:var(--muted-2); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;
    font-family:var(--sans);
  }

  /* ============ WHATSAPP FLUTUANTE ============ */
  .wa-float{
    position:fixed; right:22px; bottom:calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    z-index:90; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .wa-tooltip{
    background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    color:var(--text); font-size:13px; padding:9px 14px; border-radius:10px;
    white-space:nowrap; opacity:0; transform:translateX(6px);
    transition:opacity .25s ease, transform .25s ease; pointer-events:none;
    font-family:var(--sans);
  }
  .wa-float:hover .wa-tooltip{ opacity:1; transform:none; }
  .wa-btn{
    width:58px; height:58px; border-radius:50%;
    background:linear-gradient(145deg, #2FD86B, #1FAE55);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    box-shadow:0 12px 28px -8px rgba(31,174,85,.55);
    transition:transform .25s ease;
  }
  .wa-btn:hover{ transform:scale(1.06); }
  .wa-btn svg{ width:28px; height:28px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav class="wrap">
    <div class="logo">Tiago <span>Rocha</span></div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#solucao">O método</a>
      <a href="#beneficios">Benefícios</a>
      <a href="#depoimentos">Resultados</a>
      <a href="#faq">Perguntas</a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" style="padding:11px 22px; font-size:14px;" href="https://wa.me/351916774320?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20vim%20pelo%20site%20e%20quero%20agendar%20uma%20avalia%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20gratuita." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Falar agora</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<!-- 01 HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="reveal in">
      <div class="eyebrow">Treino personalizado · Algarve</div>
      <h1>Chega de começar em <em>setembro</em> e desistir em <em>outubro.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Para quem já tentou treinar sozinho, sentiu que a academia é grande demais e intimidante, ou parou por medo de se lesionar. Aqui o treino é feito pra você continuar — não só pra você começar.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/351916774320?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20vim%20pelo%20site%20e%20quero%20agendar%20uma%20avalia%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20gratuita." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Quero saber como funciona</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#como-funciona">Ver como funciona</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note"><span class="dot"></span> Avaliação inicial sem custo</div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual reveal in">
      <div class="stat-row">
        <span class="label">Progresso da semana</span>
        <span class="label" style="color:var(--red-light);">4/5 treinos</span>
      </div>
      <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" style="width:80%;"></div></div>
      <div class="week-row">
        <div class="week-day done">S</div>
        <div class="week-day done">T</div>
        <div class="week-day done">Q</div>
        <div class="week-day done">Q</div>
        <div class="week-day today">S</div>
        <div class="week-day">S</div>
        <div class="week-day">D</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="hero-stat"><b>100%</b><span>Treino individual</span></div>
        <div class="hero-stat"><b>0€</b><span>Avaliação inicial</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 02 PROBLEMA -->
<section class="problema">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="problema-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Isto soa familiar?</div>
      <h2>Não é falta de força de vontade.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="problem-list">
      <div class="problem-item reveal">
        <div class="mark">1</div>
        <p><strong>Já tentou treinar sozinho</strong> e desistiu depois de algumas semanas, sem saber se estava a fazer certo.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-item reveal">
        <div class="mark">2</div>
        <p><strong>Sente-se intimidado</strong> num ginásio grande, cheio de gente que parece já saber tudo o que está a fazer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-item reveal">
        <div class="mark">3</div>
        <p><strong>Tem medo de se lesionar</strong> ou de fazer um exercício errado, principalmente se já teve alguma dor ou lesão antes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-item reveal">
        <div class="mark">4</div>
        <p><strong>Já pagou por um plano de treino</strong> genérico que nunca foi ajustado à sua rotina real.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 03 SOLUÇÃO -->
<section class="solucao" id="solucao">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="solucao-copy reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">O método</div>
      <h2>O treino se adapta a você — não o contrário.</h2>
      <p>Antes de qualquer treino, há uma <strong>avaliação física completa</strong>: histórico, limitações, objetivo real — não um plano genérico copiado de outro aluno.</p>
      <p>O acompanhamento é <strong>100% individual</strong>, com ajustes constantes conforme a sua evolução — nunca a mesma ficha de treino por meses seguidos.</p>
      <p>O foco não é o treino mais difícil possível. É o treino que você consegue manter — e que, por isso, funciona.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="solucao-panel reveal">
      <div class="step-mini">
        <div class="step-num-mini">→</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Avaliação física completa</h4>
          <p>Histórico, limitações e objetivo real, sem achismos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-mini">
        <div class="step-num-mini">→</div>
        <div>
